WEBVTT

00:00:00.564 --> 00:00:05.434
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:11.934
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:28.724
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:34.084
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:40.594
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.134 --> 00:00:46.264
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:50.274
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.344 --> 00:00:55.214
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:00.424
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.154 --> 00:01:08.114
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.194 --> 00:01:14.104
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:20.734
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:26.954
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:49.864
Pathetic.

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:53.734
Can't ask much from a beginner
who just joined the game.

00:02:10.994 --> 00:02:14.084
That was a disaster.
You'd better be careful.

00:02:14.664 --> 00:02:17.654
Right now, there are
many PK's in "The World".

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:20.064
PK?

00:02:21.034 --> 00:02:22.694
Player Killers.

00:02:22.774 --> 00:02:24.564
They hunt and kill other players.

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:27.334
Like those guys before?

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.014
Umm...

00:02:43.924 --> 00:02:44.824
It's Ovan.

00:02:45.564 --> 00:02:46.184
Ovan?

00:02:47.594 --> 00:02:49.534
I'm Haseo.

00:02:52.504 --> 00:02:55.064
Thanks for saving me.

00:02:59.174 --> 00:03:00.574
Become strong.

00:03:01.674 --> 00:03:05.614
The threshold in this game
has become too high for beginners.

00:03:06.584 --> 00:03:10.144
There will be unpleasant moments
as you had back there.

00:03:10.624 --> 00:03:11.554
However...

00:03:12.184 --> 00:03:15.644
...there are also things that exist
nowhere else but in "The World".

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.854
You have a gift.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:22.654
A gift?

00:03:24.264 --> 00:03:27.164
Something special,
that only you possess.

00:03:29.204 --> 00:03:30.174
I don't get it.

00:03:30.604 --> 00:03:33.204
You'll understand one day.

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:38.674
Let's meet again soon.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:42.444
Wait!

00:04:03.174 --> 00:04:06.234
Well, I'm off.

00:04:13.584 --> 00:04:14.674
Shino! Shino!

00:04:14.914 --> 00:04:16.014
Can I really have these?

00:04:16.654 --> 00:04:17.444
Yes.

00:04:17.524 --> 00:04:18.814
Thank you!

00:04:18.984 --> 00:04:21.324
You worked hard to get this far.

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:22.854
No need to thank me.

00:04:22.924 --> 00:04:26.724
But, still...
I'd be lost without you.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:31.094
There's a map on the upper left
of the screen, right?

00:04:34.504 --> 00:04:35.474
Yup!

00:04:35.674 --> 00:04:38.694
Like I told you,
you won't get lost if you use it.

00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:41.174
But I'm not good with maps.

00:04:41.244 --> 00:04:42.304
You'll learn.

00:04:42.374 --> 00:04:44.174
But it'll be difficult until I do.

00:04:44.244 --> 00:04:45.874
You can't play unless you learn.

00:04:45.944 --> 00:04:46.744
Oh, right!

00:04:47.684 --> 00:04:48.484
Wait a minute.

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:49.484
Huh?

00:04:50.784 --> 00:04:52.274
I have to go.

00:04:52.724 --> 00:04:53.984
Uh, wait!

00:04:54.924 --> 00:04:56.654
The master is calling me.

00:04:56.724 --> 00:04:57.554
Master?

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:58.914
The Guild Master.

00:04:58.994 --> 00:05:00.894
Is that kind of like a club?

00:05:00.964 --> 00:05:01.824
This "guild"?

00:05:01.894 --> 00:05:03.764
Are you in one, Shino?

00:05:03.864 --> 00:05:06.134
Yes, the "Twilight Brigade".

00:05:06.434 --> 00:05:07.594
Will we meet again?

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:09.164
If you wish.

00:05:09.534 --> 00:05:10.634
Then, it's a promise!

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.434
You can use that email address...

00:05:13.504 --> 00:05:15.674
...if you ever need to reach me.

00:05:16.014 --> 00:05:16.564
Okay!

00:05:16.914 --> 00:05:17.674
Good-bye.

00:05:37.034 --> 00:05:38.154
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:46.674
How was it?

00:05:47.044 --> 00:05:49.174
I revived him after he got PK'd.

00:05:49.244 --> 00:05:50.574
PK'd...

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:53.174
So that's what happened.

00:05:53.784 --> 00:05:57.314
I was just trying to figure out
how to approach him...

00:05:57.384 --> 00:05:58.584
...so it worked out perfectly.

00:05:59.424 --> 00:06:00.284
You're lying.

00:06:02.754 --> 00:06:06.594
You already knew how
you were going to contact him.

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:10.524
Am I wrong?

00:06:10.634 --> 00:06:11.534
I wonder.

00:06:12.864 --> 00:06:16.494
I have a good feeling
about the girl, I think.

00:06:16.774 --> 00:06:18.904
I bet she'd join in an instant.

00:06:18.974 --> 00:06:19.994
Is that right?

00:06:20.074 --> 00:06:21.474
You'll meet her once, right?

00:06:21.544 --> 00:06:22.974
I suppose so.

00:06:23.274 --> 00:06:24.264
When can you meet her?

00:06:24.714 --> 00:06:25.734
Soon.

00:06:26.544 --> 00:06:27.514
Okay.

00:06:30.254 --> 00:06:33.124
Shall I explain this to Sakisaka?

00:06:33.724 --> 00:06:34.484
Please.

00:06:39.964 --> 00:06:43.724
We can finally restart the guild.

00:06:44.064 --> 00:06:44.624
Yes.

00:06:46.334 --> 00:06:47.664
We'll find it.

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:48.994
I'm certain.

00:06:49.134 --> 00:06:53.404
There is only one thing
that is certain in this life.

00:06:53.714 --> 00:06:54.104
Huh?

00:06:55.574 --> 00:06:59.704
All living things will one day die.

00:07:09.354 --> 00:07:10.014
But...

00:07:10.824 --> 00:07:12.124
I'll be in touch.

00:07:33.954 --> 00:07:34.884
He's here.

00:07:38.924 --> 00:07:41.254
Can't you at least be on time?

00:07:42.054 --> 00:07:44.824
Kids don't have any manners
these days.

00:07:44.994 --> 00:07:47.224
It takes forever to do business
with them.

00:07:47.464 --> 00:07:49.864
So, what's this meeting for?

00:07:49.934 --> 00:07:51.524
Ovan has made a move.

00:07:52.964 --> 00:07:53.764
Ovan?

00:07:54.104 --> 00:07:55.004
Ovan?

00:07:55.334 --> 00:07:56.104
Who's that again?

00:07:56.274 --> 00:07:58.704
Quit playing dumb.

00:07:59.604 --> 00:08:00.304
Sorry.

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:03.064
So, who is it?

00:08:03.144 --> 00:08:06.414
The Guild Master
of the Twilight Brigade.

00:08:06.584 --> 00:08:09.274
A Steam Gunner with a
modified left arm.

00:08:09.714 --> 00:08:11.554
Oh! I remember!

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:13.984
He had something
to do with Naobi...

00:08:14.054 --> 00:08:15.144
...or something like that, right?

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:19.124
If what he is looking for
actually exists...

00:08:19.294 --> 00:08:22.734
...then we of TaN
cannot just stand by and watch.

00:08:22.834 --> 00:08:24.894
Sounds like dirty work.

00:08:25.264 --> 00:08:26.994
Perfect for Ender.

00:08:27.064 --> 00:08:30.364
You and Ender are both responsible
for TaN's activities.

00:08:30.574 --> 00:08:33.834
For this assignment, Tawaraya,
you'll work the back door.

00:08:34.574 --> 00:08:35.064
I see.

00:08:35.444 --> 00:08:39.074
Ovan made contact with a beginner
who just joined the game today.

00:08:39.144 --> 00:08:41.174
He revived him
after he was PK'd.

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:43.154
After that he disappeared.

00:08:43.454 --> 00:08:45.924
I want to know all about
this beginner.

00:08:46.524 --> 00:08:47.424
His name?

00:08:47.894 --> 00:08:48.614
Haseo.

00:08:49.354 --> 00:08:51.184
A black Multi-Weapon.

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:52.894
Multi-Weapon?

00:08:53.394 --> 00:08:56.834
He sure picked a weak vocation.

00:08:57.304 --> 00:08:58.284
And black?

00:08:58.464 --> 00:08:59.454
That's cheap.

00:09:02.534 --> 00:09:04.694
The name of TaN
is not to be revealed.

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:06.304
Understood.

00:09:07.514 --> 00:09:09.444
Well, then. I guess we're off.

00:09:10.884 --> 00:09:11.604
Tawaraya!

00:09:12.244 --> 00:09:14.144
Yeah, yeah, say no more.

00:09:14.684 --> 00:09:16.374
I'll keep my antenna up.

00:09:35.674 --> 00:09:37.574
Hey, did you see that?

00:09:38.404 --> 00:09:39.534
I did! I did!

00:09:39.744 --> 00:09:42.334
He had a pretty nice staff.

00:09:42.544 --> 00:09:43.634
It's rare, right?

00:09:43.714 --> 00:09:45.184
Should we take him down?

00:09:46.044 --> 00:09:47.174
Think he'll drop it?

00:09:47.254 --> 00:09:49.584
I think it's worth a shot.

00:09:49.654 --> 00:09:50.584
I suppose.

00:09:50.654 --> 00:09:52.144
Anyway, let's follow him.

00:09:53.024 --> 00:09:55.514
Talking like that so openly...

00:09:55.824 --> 00:09:57.124
They're underestimating us.

00:09:57.224 --> 00:09:58.314
That's no good.

00:09:58.724 --> 00:09:59.854
Shall we get 'em?

00:10:00.534 --> 00:10:02.994
What's with this online game?

00:10:03.094 --> 00:10:05.324
It sure is terrible.

00:10:09.134 --> 00:10:13.544
The youth of today
are just terrible.

00:10:16.374 --> 00:10:18.744
Left behind by Ovan, huh?

00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:23.044
You know Ovan?

00:10:26.484 --> 00:10:28.514
Huh? What the...

00:10:30.964 --> 00:10:31.554
Sorry.

00:10:31.764 --> 00:10:33.924
The cats pulled the cord out.

00:10:33.994 --> 00:10:34.924
Cats?

00:10:35.034 --> 00:10:36.224
I have two.

00:10:36.394 --> 00:10:38.664
Anyway, never mind that.

00:10:40.134 --> 00:10:41.964
Let's have a little talk.

00:11:05.964 --> 00:11:10.424
I'll give you my member address.
Invite me to a chat.

00:11:10.494 --> 00:11:14.734
If we talk in a chat,
outsiders won't be able to listen in.

00:11:15.604 --> 00:11:19.134
Haven't you read the manual?
Ah, there we go.

00:11:19.874 --> 00:11:20.634
So...

00:11:21.144 --> 00:11:21.664
Why?

00:11:21.744 --> 00:11:26.374
Why did I approach you?
Why do I know about Ovan?

00:11:26.444 --> 00:11:28.284
Which did you want to ask?

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:29.774
Both?

00:11:30.684 --> 00:11:34.244
What kind of man is Ovan?

00:11:34.724 --> 00:11:36.554
Didn't you meet and talk to him?

00:11:36.854 --> 00:11:37.344
Yeah.

00:11:37.564 --> 00:11:39.054
He's exactly as you saw.

00:11:39.194 --> 00:11:40.664
What did you think of him?

00:11:41.764 --> 00:11:42.994
Just tell me.

00:11:43.664 --> 00:11:44.694
A mysterious...

00:11:45.704 --> 00:11:46.464
...guy.

00:11:46.764 --> 00:11:50.034
That's a convenient word.
Just like the word "subtle".

00:11:50.434 --> 00:11:52.134
I don't know what else to say.

00:11:52.204 --> 00:11:55.074
You know the difference
between one who's mysterious...

00:11:55.144 --> 00:11:56.664
...and one who's plain eccentric?

00:11:57.384 --> 00:11:59.674
Is he eccentric?

00:11:59.914 --> 00:12:02.614
He's a man searching
for something that doesn't exist.

00:12:02.684 --> 00:12:05.444
How can you not consider him
an eccentric man?

00:12:05.524 --> 00:12:07.714
And he even created
his own guild...

00:12:07.794 --> 00:12:11.884
...which means, there are
other players working with him.

00:12:13.924 --> 00:12:15.484
Do you understand?

00:12:15.834 --> 00:12:16.594
Guild?

00:12:17.334 --> 00:12:18.494
Read the manual!

00:12:21.034 --> 00:12:22.834
Are you reading the manual?

00:12:23.434 --> 00:12:24.264
I'll read it later.

00:12:24.804 --> 00:12:25.704
Later?

00:12:26.744 --> 00:12:29.104
There are things you'd learn
if you read it, yet you don't.

00:12:29.174 --> 00:12:31.704
You're not ashamed
of your own ignorance...

00:12:31.784 --> 00:12:35.944
...and you blame your own
shortcomings on other people.

00:12:36.014 --> 00:12:38.784
Look, if you're done with me,
I'm out of here.

00:12:38.854 --> 00:12:41.184
Naturally, you're impatient.

00:12:41.524 --> 00:12:42.784
You're impossible.

00:12:42.954 --> 00:12:45.794
Hey, what happened
between you and Ovan?

00:12:45.924 --> 00:12:46.514
Nothing.

00:12:46.764 --> 00:12:47.954
That's strange.

00:12:49.064 --> 00:12:52.724
Ever since you came to town,
he's been following you.

00:12:52.804 --> 00:12:55.064
I figured there must be a reason.

00:12:56.004 --> 00:12:56.804
Ovan?

00:12:57.544 --> 00:13:00.804
He must have had some
strange reason for it.

00:13:01.544 --> 00:13:03.774
I was being followed?

00:13:04.484 --> 00:13:09.674
I was just interested in why
that eccentric man met with you.

00:13:09.754 --> 00:13:12.654
Oh, well. Guess it doesn't matter.
I'm leaving the chat.

00:13:15.124 --> 00:13:19.114
Contact me if you're going to
play by yourself in The World.

00:13:19.194 --> 00:13:22.654
I'll show you a fun way to
play without joining a guild.

00:13:23.594 --> 00:13:24.194
And you are?

00:13:24.904 --> 00:13:27.264
I'm Phyllo.
Don't bother with "Mister".

00:13:27.474 --> 00:13:30.734
Why are you playing this game,
Phyllo?

00:13:31.404 --> 00:13:32.874
To pass the time.

00:13:50.254 --> 00:13:51.744
Hello!

00:13:56.934 --> 00:14:00.164
What was that for?!
I'm going to tell the master!

00:14:00.564 --> 00:14:01.554
My bad.

00:14:01.804 --> 00:14:03.324
So, where's Ovan?

00:14:04.644 --> 00:14:05.434
What?

00:14:05.604 --> 00:14:07.544
He's not here today, either?

00:14:07.614 --> 00:14:11.234
When are we ever going to be
able to get anything done?

00:14:11.514 --> 00:14:12.874
With only the two of us...

00:14:12.944 --> 00:14:16.214
Well, that's why I called you,
Sakisaka.

00:14:17.084 --> 00:14:20.714
In the near future, one person,
maybe two people...

00:14:20.794 --> 00:14:22.254
...will be joining the Brigade.

00:14:22.324 --> 00:14:24.084
So, get ready to
take action again.

00:14:24.764 --> 00:14:26.814
Can we use them right away?

00:14:27.594 --> 00:14:29.534
We'll take it slow.

00:14:30.134 --> 00:14:31.224
We'll take it slow, okay?

00:14:32.004 --> 00:14:33.524
Beginners, huh.

00:14:33.964 --> 00:14:36.304
I don't want to be a baby sitter.

00:14:36.374 --> 00:14:38.604
Ovan hands off the newbies to me...

00:14:38.674 --> 00:14:41.304
...while he goes solo, right?

00:14:41.544 --> 00:14:45.204
Don't forget you were
a beginner at one time, too.

00:14:45.544 --> 00:14:49.004
If those guys were still around,
I wouldn't have to baby sit.

00:14:49.084 --> 00:14:52.244
No use talking about
people who are already gone.

00:14:52.754 --> 00:14:55.954
Why did I join this guild anyway?

00:14:56.054 --> 00:14:57.254
Do you regret it?

00:14:57.524 --> 00:14:59.994
Actually, I'm perplexed
that I joined...

00:15:00.064 --> 00:15:01.994
...and I'm surprised that
I'm still around.

00:15:02.094 --> 00:15:03.824
There it is. A Sakisaka-ism!

00:15:03.894 --> 00:15:04.924
Cut it out!

00:15:21.684 --> 00:15:23.274
Made it to Level 3.

00:15:23.684 --> 00:15:25.584
This is no different
than any other game.

00:15:33.794 --> 00:15:36.564
That's not a Non-Player Character.

00:15:44.644 --> 00:15:48.234
I was getting tired
of waiting for you, Haseo.

00:15:52.584 --> 00:15:55.574
What is your connection to Ovan?

00:15:55.654 --> 00:15:58.144
Why is everyone
asking about Ovan?

00:15:58.784 --> 00:15:59.944
What's this all about?

00:16:00.124 --> 00:16:03.184
Hey, I have a short temper...

00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:04.854
...so just answer the question.

00:16:05.094 --> 00:16:06.824
There's no connection.

00:16:06.894 --> 00:16:09.924
He just revived me after
some PK'ers killed me.

00:16:10.264 --> 00:16:11.924
When did you join the game?

00:16:12.304 --> 00:16:12.854
Today.

00:16:13.304 --> 00:16:14.464
Today was my first time.

00:16:14.534 --> 00:16:15.964
You're honest. That's good.

00:16:16.834 --> 00:16:20.244
Then, why did you start
playing this game?

00:16:20.304 --> 00:16:25.404
Well, basically because a friend
said The World was a fun game.

00:16:25.914 --> 00:16:27.844
"Was?" Past tense?

00:16:28.414 --> 00:16:29.344
I see.

00:16:29.754 --> 00:16:33.954
Your friend was playing
the old version of The World.

00:16:34.794 --> 00:16:35.514
So?

00:16:35.654 --> 00:16:37.024
What do you mean, "so"?

00:16:37.094 --> 00:16:42.294
What are the chances of you
or your friend knowing the real Ovan?

00:16:42.694 --> 00:16:43.724
I don't know.

00:16:45.934 --> 00:16:47.564
Think about it carefully.

00:16:48.374 --> 00:16:50.204
You said you got PK'd, right?

00:16:50.774 --> 00:16:51.564
Why?

00:16:51.904 --> 00:16:53.494
No reason. I don't know.

00:16:54.044 --> 00:16:56.174
I think PK'ing was their hobby.

00:16:57.474 --> 00:16:59.204
How did they do it?

00:17:07.184 --> 00:17:08.454
PK.

00:17:11.824 --> 00:17:12.984
Like this?

00:17:22.574 --> 00:17:24.034
Aren't you going to beg
for your life?

00:17:28.744 --> 00:17:30.264
You can run away, you know.

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:40.184
How boring.

00:17:40.584 --> 00:17:43.494
Why would Ovan befriend
such a loser?

00:17:44.864 --> 00:17:47.484
You're not even worth PK'ing.

00:17:47.964 --> 00:17:49.984
See ya, little boy!

00:17:50.934 --> 00:17:52.164
What the...?

00:17:52.604 --> 00:17:56.434
Why?
Why does this keep happening?

00:17:58.904 --> 00:18:00.064
That was easy!

00:18:00.374 --> 00:18:03.074
And those two losers followed us.

00:18:03.614 --> 00:18:07.244
Using female characters
just lures the idiots in.

00:18:07.484 --> 00:18:09.214
What should we do with the loot?

00:18:09.284 --> 00:18:10.714
Let's sell it to TaN.

00:18:10.784 --> 00:18:11.844
We split the money even?

00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:12.574
Of course!

00:18:13.324 --> 00:18:15.954
This is why I can't stop PK'ing.

00:18:21.564 --> 00:18:24.124
That guy's been lurking around
for awhile.

00:18:24.194 --> 00:18:25.494
You noticed, too?

00:18:56.164 --> 00:18:57.394
Become strong.

00:18:58.164 --> 00:19:00.494
You have a gift.

00:19:01.274 --> 00:19:04.504
Something special
that only you possess.

00:19:05.404 --> 00:19:07.234
Let's meet again soon.

00:19:07.914 --> 00:19:09.104
Again?

00:19:09.244 --> 00:19:10.044
When?

00:19:13.514 --> 00:19:15.414
What gift?

00:19:15.884 --> 00:19:17.904
Why me?

00:19:20.454 --> 00:19:23.324
I shouldn't have started
playing this game.

00:19:27.764 --> 00:19:29.454
I can't do this.

00:19:33.434 --> 00:19:34.454
Hello!

00:19:35.534 --> 00:19:37.764
You're alone, aren't you?
We'll play with you.

00:19:40.374 --> 00:19:41.804
I'll give you a handicap.

00:19:46.414 --> 00:19:49.074
You can throw him that far
with your bare hands!

00:19:54.124 --> 00:19:55.784
Oh! So brave!

00:19:56.024 --> 00:19:59.284
But, if you don't recover,
you won't survive the next hit.

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:03.464
Here goes...

00:20:05.434 --> 00:20:07.764
Wonder how much longer
you'll last?

00:20:08.104 --> 00:20:09.794
What are you doing?

00:20:09.874 --> 00:20:11.964
Hm, that's weird.

00:20:17.144 --> 00:20:20.044
Hey, are you a
second form character?

00:20:21.714 --> 00:20:22.944
That can't be.

00:20:23.014 --> 00:20:24.714
He just got lucky.
Just lucky.

00:20:30.254 --> 00:20:31.784
Lucky.

00:20:32.124 --> 00:20:35.024
You're too weak
to be playing solo.

00:20:35.094 --> 00:20:35.924
Right.

00:20:42.834 --> 00:20:43.994
You're annoying.

00:20:48.074 --> 00:20:49.444
I said you're annoying!

00:20:51.514 --> 00:20:52.484
Stop that.

00:21:02.154 --> 00:21:05.354
If you want to fight other players,
go to the arena.

00:21:06.124 --> 00:21:08.684
It's not like that, right?

00:21:37.524 --> 00:21:39.614
You can't quit.

00:21:45.164 --> 00:21:48.334
I don't know who you are...

00:21:48.604 --> 00:21:51.574
...but this stupid game
doesn't make any sense.

00:21:51.904 --> 00:21:54.604
Don't say that...

00:21:56.144 --> 00:21:58.974
...because we need you.

00:22:01.684 --> 00:22:05.054
Welcome to The World.

00:22:11.724 --> 00:22:15.094
I don't get what you're
talking about.

00:22:29.574 --> 00:22:33.174
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.244 --> 00:22:36.684
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:36.954 --> 00:22:40.684
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.754 --> 00:22:44.784
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.294 --> 00:22:51.894
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:51.964 --> 00:22:55.594
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:55.674 --> 00:23:02.904
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:02.974 --> 00:23:06.644
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:06.714 --> 00:23:10.414
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.484 --> 00:23:17.414
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:17.594 --> 00:23:21.324
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.394 --> 00:23:24.424
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:24.494 --> 00:23:31.964
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.204 --> 00:23:35.404
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:35.474 --> 00:23:39.504
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:39.614 --> 00:23:43.204
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.284 --> 00:23:46.844
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:46.924 --> 00:23:50.654
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:50.724 --> 00:23:54.494
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:55.334 --> 00:23:57.264
Next Episode...
